hearse client has deleted it.
I don't remember what the game does when it encounters an unusable bones
file and panics: does it delete it or leave it on the disk.

You said you have encountered the same problem twice within a short time.
I wonder if the first time there was a bad bones file that got deleted,
but the game left behind a bad level file that crashed the game next time,
